OL,5,G2000 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FIn south London, Peter and Kate
OL,7,     Fface an uphill battle to get out
OL,8,     Fof Kate's rental. And can Canadian
OL,9,     Fcouple Mel and Cody land their
OL,10,     Fperfect pad in their favourite
OL,11,     Farea?
OL,12,G2100 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FKevin revisits Chris and Gill's
OL,14,     Fambitious Huddersfield mill
OL,15,     Fconversion. Has their meticulous,
OL,16,     Fperfectionist approach stood the
OL,17,     Ftest of time? And does their home
OL,18,     Fstill feel as radical today?
